        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, facade substructure, integrated, concrete substrate, Ecolite, to final disposal
Aluminium profiles and chromium steel parts are assumed to be recycled at the end of life. Insulation bars and other plastic components are treated in a municipal waste incineration plant.;
